  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Rights Awareness in Business</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Human Rights Awareness in Business</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to create a fairer and more equitable working environment by increasing awareness of human rights in the business sector. It focused on improving employers&#x2019; knowledge about legal requirements and on strengthening employees&#x2019; awareness of their rights.</narrative>
